== Usage ==
This template creates a green difficulty infobox. Fields are displayed only when their parameters are supplied.

<pre>
{{Difficulty infobox
 | name = Example Difficulty
 | category = Tower difficulty
 | description = A short, neutral description.
 | criteria = Summarize the established classification criteria.
}}
</pre>

Parameters:
* name — heading; defaults to the current page title.
* category, description, criteria — optional classification details.

This template uses the #if parser function, which requires the MediaWiki ParserFunctions extension. Preview it in a sandbox before using it on live pages.
</noinclude>